{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"yexVj09OH5n_X-MT_Lq5rg","review_id":"IRK7sauuMKFqkRSUrQimDg","date":"2015-08-19T02:25:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9361319541931152,"text_excerpt":"In comparison, not my favorite John Besh place in NOLA. I'll save that for August or Borgne. Maybe because its in a casino it just comes with a stigma. However! We ordered one seafood dish, the Catfish smothered in creamy crab and one steak dish, the filet of beef tenderloin. It came on a bed of scalloped potatoes (sooo good) and asparagus. We also ordered a side of rosemary red potatoes. All very delicious! The complimentary Pate was also nice. I love free treats. This place also had a very extensive wine list if you are into that kind of thing!"},{"business_id":"yexVj09OH5n_X-MT_Lq5rg","review_id":"-Am21mY58jPiGHhf3HEMUQ","date":"2020-11-11T16:54:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.928889274597168,"text_excerpt":"I had a really nice experience here. Despite being in the middle of a casino, once your inside, the casino noises and atmosphere is erased to a whole different mood and ambiance. The atmosphere is intimate and relaxed. lights are dimly lit but not too dim. I could still see the menu easily. Service was excellent. Ruby was our server. She was delightful, patient, and very attentive. Even though we called on her a lot , she always met us with a smile. Top notch service for sure. Food was delicious. when you go to a steakhouse, you get steak. That is exactly what I did, ya hear! Prices are what you expect for an upscale steakhouse. I believe we spent about $600 for 6 people. That included dr..."},{"business_id":"yexVj09OH5n_X-MT_Lq5rg","review_id":"gG-8OegPSWfSNtcT6lUZJQ","date":"2013-06-05T13:49:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9284856915473938,"text_excerpt":"This place was amazing! For the appetizer we got the Besh BBQ Shrimp, it was wonderful. This was one of the few places I saw that it did not have the shell and heads on, so I was happy about that! For our entrees my husband got the Cast-iron Roast Ribeye Of Beef With peppercorn sauce & fries, I got the Berkshire Pork Chop with Crab and Corn Orzo Risotto. Both were fantastic! For dessert, we shared the Brendan's Bread Pudding. Again, FANTASTIC! Loved our meal! every bite of it!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yexVj09OH5n_X-MT_Lq5rg","photo_id":"Ct98q5SEs3rJCD4U-gNceQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Ct98q5SEs3rJCD4U-gNceQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9392320513725281},{"business_id":"yexVj09OH5n_X-MT_Lq5rg","photo_id":"btkbfcViEVUX9QymqdXBuw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/btkbfcViEVUX9QymqdXBuw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8828881978988647},{"business_id":"yexVj09OH5n_X-MT_Lq5rg","photo_id":"zG7-o0MZW78OR8mIZ4lUjA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zG7-o0MZW78OR8mIZ4lUjA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.853835940361023},{"business_id":"yexVj09OH5n_X-MT_Lq5rg","photo_id":"tiuVp2gjjcTBemMoBFVRVQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tiuVp2gjjcTBemMoBFVRVQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8427532911300659},{"business_id":"yexVj09OH5n_X-MT_Lq5rg","photo_id":"-Q00aB6rmz4UDttc72mZHw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-Q00aB6rmz4UDttc72mZHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8361635208129883}]},"notebook_case":null}
